 "sentences": [
  "Jane Cobden was elected, then legally blocked.",
  "She won a seat on the 1889 London County Council.",
  "This made her one of just 2 women elected.",
  "However, legal challenges prevented her from serving as a councillor.",
  "She spent her life fighting for women's suffrage and Irish independence.",
  "Even while supporting radicals, she kept her own activism strictly within the law."
